---
/* ============================================================
   AboutSection.astro — "About me", shown on the homepage under
   the hero. id="about" lets links jump straight to it
   (the scroll arrow, and the old /about address).
   ============================================================ */
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <h2 class="about-title">About me</h2>

  <div class="about-body">
    <div class="about-content">
      <p>
        I come from Poland and I'm currently based in <strong>Delft, the Netherlands</strong>.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>BA in Graphic Design from Royal Academy of Art, the Hague</strong>
        with a graduation project VR experience <em>"Echoes of Abandonment"</em>.
      </p>

      <p>
        Experience working with interactive media such as
        <strong>games, VR, AR, websites</strong>.
        Additionally <strong>graphic design projects</strong>,
        such as <strong>visual identity, illustration, or book and printed media design</strong>.
      </p>

      <p>
        Currently doing <strong>Master's of Game Technology
        in Breda University of Applied Sciences</strong>
        with research focus on the <strong>UI/UX in VR games</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-cta">
      <a href="/portfolio" class="btn btn-primary">See my work →</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 7rem) var(--space-page);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;                       /* heading on top on phones */
    gap: 1.5rem clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    scroll-margin-top: 1rem;               /* a little space above when jumped to */
  }

  .about-title {
    flex: 1 1 14rem;                       /* KNOB: width of the heading column */
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-purple);
  }

  .about-body {
    flex: 2.5 1 26rem;
    max-width: 44rem;                      /* comfortable line length for reading */
  }

  .about-content p {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .about-content strong {
    color: var(--color-purple);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-content em {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .btn {
    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

  .btn-primary {
    background-color: var(--color-purple);
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-blue);
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--color-purple);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-purple);
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-purple);
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .btn { transition: none; }
    .btn:hover { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
